docs {
  # Get All Friendships (`GetFriendships`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetFriendships` in [friendship_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/friendship_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/friendships` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Retrieves all friendship records involving the current authenticated user (both sent and received, whether `PENDING` or `ACCEPTED`):
  - Preloads full `User` and `Friend` profile associations.
  - Useful for displaying incoming pending invitations, sent requests, and accepted connections.
}
